OPEN_QUESTION TheEnergyOfTheSkeoMachinesIsMeasuredInGame
	DESC "how much power do TreePlanter3, PodUnderground and RocketAnimals2 draw or produce in game"
		+ "2.103, none being a valid answer"
		REF @DATATABLE.EnergyLevels
	BLOCKS @TASK.FEAT66
	RATIONALE "The wiki documents no energy for the three machines and a missing value is never a"
		+ "zero; the user measures them in game, ruled on 2026-09-21 in the refinement of the task"
	SOURCE "Wiki pages read on 2026-09-21, no energy field on the three infoboxes"
		REF @URL.WikiFurniture
		REF @URL.WikiRockets
		REF @URL.WikiBaseBuilding
		REF @GAME_RELEASE.2.103

